WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.537
Lab 1 runs on a laptop
with Python and no tenant.

2
00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.351
First, lint Learn's three
samples as published:

3
00:00:06.351 --> 00:00:10.643
the first two have several findings
each, unpinned actions and latest

4
00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:14.788
versions among them, and the third
fails because it isn't valid at all.

5
00:00:14.788 --> 00:00:17.862
Then lint the chapter's own
workflow, and it's clean.

6
00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:20.592
Print the GCC profile to see its hosts,

7
00:00:20.592 --> 00:00:24.025
and try a cloud name the
kit doesn't know: refused.

8
00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:27.887
Then record the first day's run
as a baseline and package it.

9
00:00:27.887 --> 00:00:31.780
Note the manifest hash; the next
package will point back to it.
